          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ignoré"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stored in iCloud Keychain, so your other devices signed in to the same Apple Account can use them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enregistrés dans le trousseau iCloud, vos autres appareils connectés au même compte Apple peuvent donc les utiliser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The API password is set in FreshRSS under Profile and differs from the web password. Enable the API first under Settings, Authentication.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le mot de passe d'API se règle dans FreshRSS sous Profil et diffère du mot de passe web. Activez d'abord l'API sous Configuration, Authentification."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The article state could not be put back, check it by hand.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'état de l'article n'a pas pu être rétabli, vérifiez-le à la main."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The credentials stored in the keychain could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les identifiants enregistrés dans le trousseau n'ont pas pu être lus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The credentials will be removed from the keychain, on this device and on the others.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les identifiants seront supprimés du trousseau, sur cet appareil comme sur les autres."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The second page returned the same article, the continuation was ignored.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La deuxième page a renvoyé le même article, la continuation a été ignorée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server accepted the change but the state did not move.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le serveur a accepté la modification mais l'état n'a pas bougé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server address is not valid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'adresse du serveur n'est pas valide."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server did not return an authentication token.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le serveur n'a pas renvoyé de jeton d'authentification."
